  "resolution": [
    "A canonical validated VisualStyle.theme supplies background, primaryText, secondaryText and accent. Creation defaults to dark; light and explicit custom colors use the same validation.",
    "Composition paints the real background and caps all themed decoration to an isolated 8% group behind Scenes. Theme validation covers the worst opaque sRGB blend envelope; source guard rejects direct CSS/DOM and side-effect escapes.",
